Dialogue: 0,0:00:0.00,0:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,David? David what? David, David, listen. Listen to me. David? David, listen. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't understand the reasons but I have to leave you here. Is it a game? When will
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you come back for me? I'm not, David. You'll have to be here by yourself. Oh, with Tandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:01:6.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No, no, no, no. No, no. No, Mommy. Please, no. Please, no. I would destroy you, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:6.00,0:01:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mommy. No, I'm sorry. I'm so sorry. I could have your hair off and I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't know. I have to go. I have to go. Stop it. No, Mommy. I have to go. Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, if Pinocchio became a real boy and I become a real boy, can I come home?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a story. This story tells what happens. Stories are not real. It's not that Mommy is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen. Look. Look. Take this. All right. Take this. Don't let anyone see how much it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Now look. Don't go that way. All right. Look. Look at me. Look. Don't go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:01:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Go anywhere, but that way or I'll catch you. Don't ever let them catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:02:3.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen. Stay away from flesh fares. Away from there are lots of people. Stay away from all people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:3.00,0:02:8.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Only others like you. Only Mecca are safe. I'm going to go. Why do you want to leave me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:8.00,0:02:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to leave me? I'm sorry. I'm not real. If you let me, I'll be so real for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.00,0:02:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them leave you. Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I didn't tell you about the world.